      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature targets you with an attack and you can see the attacker.</p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You are ready to channel your aspects at a moment’s notice. You enter @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.YuGGBsR7zotqRx7C]{Stance: Storm Surge Stance} and use @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.IlsT2gN1bwoO8WDD]{Lightning Dance} prior to resolving the attack. You can enter the stance even if you aren’t in a state of heightened power, but you must acquire the state by the end of your turn to remain in the stance.</span></p>"
